## $entry here is a WeblogEntryWrapper (either from the site-wide entries
## pager or a pinned entry -- weblog.vm #sets $entry to each before including
## this fragment). Renders one row of "Latest across the site": mono date,
## serif-weight title linking to the entry's OWN weblog (frontpage has no
## permalink template of its own -- $entry.permalink already resolves to the
## contributing weblog's URL), and a "from <weblog>" credit.
## Per docs/design/journal/frontpage-front-door.html's .fd-post.
<div class="fd-post">
    <span class="d">$utils.formatDate($entry.pubTime, "MMM dd")</span>
    <div>
        <p class="t"><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($entry.permalink)">$utils.truncateNicely($utils.removeHTML($entry.title), 50, 50, "...")</a></p>
        ## $entry.website.name is a WeblogWrapper property, already escaped
        ## by WeblogWrapper#getName -- see weblog.vm's fd-dir comment.
        <p class="from">from <a href="$utils.escapeHTML($entry.website.URL)"><b>$entry.website.name</b></a></p>
    </div>
</div>
